Pope Benedict: Greetings Child.
Pope Benedict: It seems you have made it past my guards.
Pope Benedict: You may have foiled my plan to ruin the minds of Italians, but I have something that is much more powerful than you simple brainrot animals?
    -> What's that?
        Pope Benedict: (laughs)
        Pope Benedict: The ultimate brainrot...
        Pope Benedict: CHRISTIANITY!
            <<startcombatup PopeBenedict>>
    -> Shut up, old man!
        Pope Benedict: Impudent fool! I shall defeat you with the power of Christ!
        <<startcombatup PopeBenedict>>

